---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About booxnet.com – Disclaimer"
  description="booxnet.com is an unofficial fan project covering ONYX BOOX E-Ink tablets. Learn about the project, our mission and the important disclaimer."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">

    <!-- Page header -->
    <header class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-ink-200">
      <p class="text-2xs font-bold uppercase tracking-editorial text-ink-400 mb-3">
        The Project
      </p>
      <h1 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink-900 mb-2 tracking-tight">About booxnet.com</h1>
      <p class="text-ink-500 text-lg">Unofficial community project covering ONYX BOOX E-Ink tablets</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Important Disclaimer — dark panel -->
    <aside class="mb-12 rounded-xl bg-ink-900 text-ink-200 p-6 sm:p-8 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[3px] bg-ink-500" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <h2 class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-display font-bold text-xl text-ink-50 mb-4">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-ink-300 flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.485 2.495c.673-1.167 2.357-1.167 3.03 0l6.28 10.875c.673 1.167-.17 2.625-1.516 2.625H3.72c-1.347 0-2.189-1.458-1.515-2.625L8.485 2.495zM10 5a.75.75 0 01.75.75v3.5a.75.75 0 01-1.5 0v-3.5A.75.75 0 0110 5zm0 9a1 1 0 100-2 1 1 0 000 2z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        Important Disclaimer
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
        <strong class="text-ink-50">booxnet.com is an unofficial fan and community project.</strong> This website has
        <strong class="text-ink-50">no affiliation whatsoever</strong> with Onyx International Co., Ltd. or the BOOX™ brand.
      </p>
      <ul class="text-sm text-ink-300 space-y-2">
        {[
          'We are not authorized to speak on behalf of Onyx International',
          'All trademarks (BOOX, ONYX, ONYX BOOX) are property of Onyx International Co., Ltd.',
          'Product information is based on publicly available sources and our own testing',
          'We make no guarantee for the accuracy of specification details',
        ].map(item => (
          <li class="flex gap-2.5">
            <span class="mt-[7px] h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-ink-400 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            {item}
          </li>
        ))}
        <li class="flex gap-2.5">
          <span class="mt-[7px] h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-ink-400 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>
            For official information visit
            <a href="https://www.boox.com" class="text-ink-50 underline decoration-ink-600 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ink-300 transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">boox.com</a>
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </aside>

    <div class="prose-article">
      <h2>What is booxnet.com?</h2>
      <p>
        booxnet.com is an international fan blog specializing in ONYX BOOX E-Ink tablets
        and e-readers. Our team of e-reader enthusiasts writes independent reviews,
        compares devices, and publishes news about the BOOX product family.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>
        We want to provide the community around ONYX BOOX devices with high-quality,
        independent content. Our core values:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Independence:</strong> Our opinions are not influenced by manufacturers or retailers.</li>
        <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> Affiliate links are clearly labeled.</li>
        <li><strong>Quality:</strong> We test devices thoroughly before writing about them.</li>
        <li><strong>Community:</strong> We welcome feedback, corrections and suggestions.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Our Categories</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>News:</strong> Current reports on new BOOX devices, software updates and announcements.</li>
        <li><strong>Reviews:</strong> In-depth tests of BOOX E-Ink tablets and e-readers.</li>
        <li><strong>Comparisons:</strong> Direct head-to-heads between different models.</li>
        <li><strong>Guides:</strong> Tutorials and tips for setup and daily use.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Languages</h2>
      <p>
        booxnet.com is published in English, with the interface also available in
        Spanish, French and Russian. Article translations are added over time.
      </p>

      <h2>Liability Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        The information published on this website is for informational purposes only.
        We make no warranty as to the timeliness, correctness or completeness of the
        information provided. Always base purchase decisions on multiple sources.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions, feedback or partnership inquiries? Reach us via our
        <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
